[% META title = "Hive Management System" %]
[% PageVersion = 'Apiary/hive_management.tt,v 0.02 2026/03/17 shanta Exp shanta' %]
[% IF debug_mode == 1 %]
    [% PageVersion %]
[% END %]

<div class="app-container">

    <div class="page-header">
        <h1>Hive Management System</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Track and manage your hives through every season.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="content-primary">

            <div class="app-section">
                <p>Welcome to the Hive Management System. This system helps beekeepers track inspections, monitor colony strength, and plan seasonal activities.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="app-section">
                <h2>Hive Inspection Checklist</h2>
                <div class="content-section">
                    <p>During each inspection, record observations for:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Queen presence and laying pattern</li>
                        <li>Brood pattern and development stages</li>
                        <li>Food stores — honey and pollen frames</li>
                        <li>Population strength (frames of bees)</li>
                        <li>Disease and pest signs</li>
                        <li>Equipment condition</li>
                        <li>Space requirements</li>
                        <li>Swarm indicators (queen cells, overcrowding)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="app-section">
                <h2>Seasonal Management</h2>
                <div class="content-section">
                    <h3>Spring</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Clean and inspect equipment after winter</li>
                        <li>Assess colony strength and survival</li>
                        <li>Feed if food stores are low</li>
                        <li>Manage for swarm prevention</li>
                        <li>Add supers as colony expands</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="content-section">
                    <h3>Summer</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Monitor honey flow progress</li>
                        <li>Add honey supers before they are needed</li>
                        <li>Manage ventilation during heat</li>
                        <li>Monitor Varroa mite levels</li>
                        <li>Harvest honey at peak ripeness</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="content-section">
                    <h3>Fall</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Assess and top up food stores</li>
                        <li>Treat for Varroa mites</li>
                        <li>Reduce entrances to prevent robbing</li>
                        <li>Combine weak colonies if needed</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="content-section">
                    <h3>Winter</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Insulate hives appropriately for your climate</li>
                        <li>Ensure adequate upper ventilation</li>
                        <li>Protect from prevailing winds</li>
                        <li>Monitor food stores through winter checks</li>
                        <li>Clear entrances of snow or debris</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="app-section">
                <h2>Voice Inspection Recording</h2>
                <div class="content-section">
                    <p>Record a spoken hive inspection. It is transcribed (Whisper) and saved as a draft inspection you can review and edit before keeping.</p>
                    <div id="apiary-voice" class="apiary-voice" data-transcribe="/ai2/transcribe" data-status="/ai2/transcribe_status" data-hives="/ai2/apiary_voice_hives" data-save="/ai2/apiary_voice_save" data-recordings="/Apiary/voice_recordings">
                        <label for="av-yard" class="av-label">Yard:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="av-yard" name="av-yard" class="av-input" placeholder="Yard ID (optional — shows all hives if blank)">

                        <label for="av-hive" class="av-label">Hive:</label>
                        <select id="av-hive" name="av-hive" class="av-input">
                            <option value="">— select hive —</option>
                        </select>

                        <div class="av-controls">
                            <button type="button" id="av-mic" class="av-btn" title="Record voice inspection — click to start, click again to stop">🎤 Record</button>
                            <label class="av-btn av-btn-file" title="Upload a saved audio file for transcription">📂 Upload
                                <input type="file" id="av-file" accept="audio/*,.m4a,.wav,.mp3,.ogg,.webm" hidden>
                            </label>
                            <span id="av-status" class="av-status"></span>
                        </div>

                        <div id="av-transcript-wrap" class="av-transcript-wrap" hidden>
                            <h3>Transcript</h3>
                            <textarea id="av-transcript" class="av-transcript" rows="6" readonly></textarea>

                            <h3>Inspection draft</h3>
                            <div class="av-fields">
                                <label class="av-field"><input type="checkbox" id="av-queen_seen"> Queen seen</label>
                                <label class="av-field"><input type="checkbox" id="av-queen_marked"> Queen marked</label>
                                <label class="av-field"><input type="checkbox" id="av-eggs_seen"> Eggs seen</label>
                                <label class="av-field"><input type="checkbox" id="av-larvae_seen"> Larvae seen</label>
                                <label class="av-field"><input type="checkbox" id="av-capped_brood_seen"> Capped brood</label>
                                <label class="av-field"><input type="checkbox" id="av-feeding_done"> Feeding done</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="av-fields">
                                <label class="av-field">Population:
                                    <select id="av-population_estimate">
                                        <option value="">—</option>
                                        <option value="very_strong">very strong</option>
                                        <option value="strong">strong</option>
                                        <option value="moderate">moderate</option>
                                        <option value="weak">weak</option>
                                        <option value="very_weak">very weak</option>
                                    </select>
                                </label>
                                <label class="av-field">Temperament:
                                    <select id="av-temperament">
                                        <option value="">—</option>
                                        <option value="calm">calm</option>
                                        <option value="moderate">moderate</option>
                                        <option value="aggressive">aggressive</option>
                                        <option value="very_aggressive">very aggressive</option>
                                    </select>
                                </label>
                                <label class="av-field">Status:
                                    <select id="av-overall_status">
                                        <option value="">—</option>
                                        <option value="excellent">excellent</option>
                                        <option value="good">good</option>
                                        <option value="fair">fair</option>
                                        <option value="poor">poor</option>
                                        <option value="critical">critical</option>
                                    </select>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="av-fields">
                                <label class="av-field">Swarm cells: <input type="number" id="av-swarm_cells" min="0" class="av-num"></label>
                                <label class="av-field">Queen cells: <input type="number" id="av-queen_cells" min="0" class="av-num"></label>
                                <label class="av-field">Supersedure: <input type="number" id="av-supersedure_cells" min="0" class="av-num"></label>
                            </div>
                            <label class="av-field" style="display:block;">Notes:
                                <textarea id="av-general_notes" class="av-transcript" rows="3"></textarea>
                            </label>

                            <div class="av-save-row">
                                <button type="button" id="av-save" class="av-btn av-btn-primary" disabled>Save inspection draft</button>
                                <span id="av-save-status" class="av-status"></span>
                                <a href="/Apiary/voice_recordings" class="av-link">View recordings →</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <style>
                        .apiary-voice .av-label{display:inline-block;min-width:48px;font-weight:600;margin-right:.4rem;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-input{margin:.2rem .8rem .6rem 0;padding:.4rem .6rem;border:1px solid var(--border-color,#ccc);border-radius:6px;background:var(--background-color,#fff);color:var(--text-color,#222);}
                        .apiary-voice .av-controls{margin:.4rem 0 1rem;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-btn{display:inline-block;padding:.45rem .9rem;border:1px solid var(--button-border,#ccc);border-radius:6px;background:var(--button-bg,#f0f0f0);color:var(--button-text,#000);cursor:pointer;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.2;margin-right:.5rem;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-btn-file{position:relative;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-btn-primary{background:var(--button-primary-bg,#2563eb);color:var(--button-primary-text,#fff);border-color:var(--button-primary-bg,#2563eb);}
                        .apiary-voice .av-btn:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-status{font-size:.85em;color:var(--text-muted,#666);}
                        .apiary-voice .av-transcript-wrap{margin-top:.6rem;padding:.8rem;border:1px solid var(--border-color,#ddd);border-radius:8px;background:var(--table-header-bg,#f8fbff);}
                        .apiary-voice .av-transcript{width:100%;margin:.3rem 0 .8rem;padding:.5rem;border:1px solid var(--border-color,#ccc);border-radius:6px;background:var(--background-color,#fff);color:var(--text-color,#222);font-family:inherit;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-fields{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem 1.2rem;margin:.4rem 0;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-field{font-size:.92em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-num{width:4.5rem;padding:.25rem .4rem;border:1px solid var(--border-color,#ccc);border-radius:5px;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-link{margin-left:auto;color:var(--link-color,#2563eb);text-decoration:none;}
                        .apiary-voice .av-save-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;margin-top:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
                        .apiary-voice .recording{background:#dc2626;color:#fff;border-color:#dc2626;}
                    </style>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="app-section">
                <h2>Hive Records</h2>
                <div class="content-section">
                    <p>Keeping detailed records is essential for successful beekeeping. For each hive, track:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Queen information — age, source, performance</li>
                        <li>Inspection dates and key findings</li>
                        <li>Treatments applied and dates</li>
                        <li>Feeding records</li>
                        <li>Honey harvest amounts</li>
                        <li>Equipment additions or changes</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p><em>Digital hive record keeping system coming soon.</em></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="app-section">
                <h2>View Hives by Yard</h2>
                <div class="content-section">
                    <div class="form-container">
                        <form action="/Apiary/hives_for_yard" method="get" class="app-form">
                            <div class="form-row">
                                <div class="form-field">
                                    <label for="yard_id">Yard ID:</label>
                                    <input type="text" name="yard_id" id="yard_id" class="form-input" placeholder="Enter yard ID">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-actions">
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">View Hives</button>
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="page-footer">
                <div class="footer-actions">
                    <a href="/Apiary" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Apiary Management</a>
                    <a href="/BMaster" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to BMaster Home</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</div>
